Package: lab4
Title: Linear Regression Using QR Decomposition and Reference Classes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jonas", "Hautamäki Bengtsson", , "jonha849@student.liu.se", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements multiple linear regression with the coefficients
    and their variances computed using the QR decomposition. The results are 
    stored in a reference class object with methods for printing, plotting, 
    residuals predictions, coefficients and a summary of the fitted model.
